{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/deputy\" title=\"deputy\">deputy</a> to a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/president\" title=\"president\">president</a>, often <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/empower\" title=\"empower\">empowered</a> to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/assume\" title=\"assume\">assume</a> the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/position\" title=\"position\">position</a> of president on their <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/death\" title=\"death\">death</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/absence\" title=\"absence\">absence</a>."},{"definition":"An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/executive\" title=\"executive\">executive</a> in a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/business\" title=\"business\">business</a> in charge of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/department\" title=\"department\">department</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/branch\" title=\"branch\">branch</a>."}]}]}